\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/729530/extras/3c41acb2cb85add46a1d4eee731b6654.avif?t=1667476664\" /></div><br>A young woman who lives in a small, easily overlooked village in Littleoak Forest. She\u2019s cheerful and clumsy, but years of study have shaped her into an incredibly powerful mage.<br>Cecily\u2019s main talents lie in casting ice spells, summoning magic bullets with a flick of her fingertips, and cooking pancakes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Join Arcadia on her adventure in this kinetic Visual Novel</li><li>Experience an exciting fantasy story</li><li>Available in English <strong>and </strong>Chinese</li><li>Beautiful graphics to visualize the story</li></ul>",
